# Homepage hero scroll-animation A/B flag. One of:
#   parallax-settle  (default) — layered parallax + scale/fade settle-out as the hero scrolls away
#   pinned-curtain              — hero pins full-viewport while the next section slides up over it
#   stats-rise                  — track-record stats rise into the hero as you start scrolling
#   chevron-cue                 — today's hero plus a bouncing scroll-down indicator
# Restart the dev server / rebuild after changing this — it's inlined at build time.
NEXT_PUBLIC_HERO_VARIANT=parallax-settle
